      "message": "There was a fix (b/186829273) recently, so these invalid process record won\u0027t be inserted into the LRU list.\n\nSpecically for this one, IIUC, it\u0027s more like a race condition, where two threads both tries to start the target process with the same process record instance, thus the startSeq could go wrong. To fix this issue, we\u0027d probably need to add a check to make sure we won\u0027t start the process again if it\u0027s already pending to start.",
